DISCLAIMER FOR VETERANS:

This software is provided for educational and informational purposes only.
It is NOT a substitute for official VA guidance, legal advice, or medical
advice.

THIS TOOL IS NOT AFFILIATED WITH OR ENDORSED BY THE U.S. DEPARTMENT OF
VETERANS AFFAIRS.

For official information and assistance with disability claims:
- Visit: https://www.va.gov/
- Call: 1-800-827-1000
- Crisis Line: Dial 988 then Press 1

Always consult with:
- VA Regional Office representatives
- Accredited VA claim representatives or Veterans Service Officers
- Licensed attorneys for legal matters
- Medical professionals for health concerns
